@*
    App shell chrome only. The visible shell (topbar + view tabs + panes) is owned by the
    single page (Browse) per the layout decision (docs/decisions.md § Product: persistent
    tree + contextual pane; spec aspireldap#102).

    There is no login gate by decision (docs/decisions.md § Scope): the app binds with the
    AppHost-provided credentials and opens straight onto the directory.

    Theming is the data-theme attribute App.razor's boot script stamps on <html> (persisted
    choice, AppHost default, prefers-color-scheme fallback); dark is a token-override layer
    in console.css, so no theme component renders here.
*@
@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@Body

@* Kept from the template so an unhandled circuit error is still announced; hidden by the
   inline style until blazor.web.js flips display on error, so no stylesheet is needed. *@
<div id="blazor-error-ui" data-nosnippet style="display: none;">
    An unhandled error has occurred.
    <a href="." class="reload">Reload</a>
</div>
